{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_029umi0484_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_029umi0484_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "e505d63c0ab83e8cee4ff244dbce4b358dbcf0ee64cf260b2fbd6f4775cd8a21", "ja": "はっ！？　そうだった～！　めぐみーたちにも、\nウサ耳パワーがついてるんだった……！", "zh": "啊！？对哦～！惠美她们也有兔耳力量来着……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
